--
-- IMPORTANT:
-- 1. Assumes pattern_type values are exactly 'allow' and 'deny'.
-- 2. Uses match_type='regex' for all generated regex patterns.
-- 3. Deny patterns receive priority 10; allow patterns receive priority 100.
-- 4. Patterns are regex fragments designed to match either a full URL or URL path.
-- 5. Candidate/inactive sources receive inactive patterns.
-- 6. Review patterns against the actual crawler matcher and current website structure
--    before production crawling. Website routes can change.
-- 7. Run medintel_sources_seed_v2.sql first, because source_id is resolved by source code.

